      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "TRAGEDY AVERTED: AGENTS RESCUE TWO FROM SUFFOCATING HEAT❗\n \nIn a harrowing display of the callousness of human smuggling, USBP agents and the National Park Service found two individuals trapped inside the trunk of a car as temperatures soared close to 100 degrees. One individual was in immediate distress and required advanced medical care. Without hesitation, agents provided medical assistance until EMS arrived. He was transported to a local hospital for further evaluation. Two smugglers were arrested and are facing enhanced alien smuggling charges. The other illegal alien will be processed and deported.\n\nThis underscores a harsh truth: human smugglers will risk lives for profit.\n\n@usbpchieftca",
      "text_resolved": "TRAGEDY AVERTED: AGENTS RESCUE TWO FROM SUFFOCATING HEAT❗\n \nIn a harrowing display of the callousness of human smuggling, USBP agents and the National Park Service found two individuals trapped inside the trunk of a car as temperatures soared close to 100 degrees. One individual was in immediate distress and required advanced medical care. Without hesitation, agents provided medical assistance until EMS arrived. He was transported to a local hospital for further evaluation. Two smugglers were arrested and are facing enhanced alien smuggling charges. The other illegal alien will be processed and deported.\n\nThis underscores a harsh truth: human smugglers will risk lives for profit.\n\n@usbpchieftca",
