      "text": "CHECKPOINT INTERDICTION: COCAINE SEIZURE 🚨\n \nIn Amado, AZ, a Mexican national attempted to pass through a USBP immigration checkpoint with 20 lbs. of cocaine hidden in her SUV. Sharp-eyed agents spotted tampering in the backseat, and a USBP K-9 confirmed their suspicions. A closer inspection revealed eight packages in a compartment beneath the back seat.\n \nThe driver, traveling on a visitor visa, was arrested and now faces federal drug charges, and her visa is in the process of being revoked. \n\n@usbpchieftca",
      "text_resolved": "CHECKPOINT INTERDICTION: COCAINE SEIZURE 🚨\n \nIn Amado, AZ, a Mexican national attempted to pass through a USBP immigration checkpoint with 20 lbs. of cocaine hidden in her SUV. Sharp-eyed agents spotted tampering in the backseat, and a USBP K-9 confirmed their suspicions. A closer inspection revealed eight packages in a compartment beneath the back seat.\n \nThe driver, traveling on a visitor visa, was arrested and now faces federal drug charges, and her visa is in the process of being revoked. \n\n@usbpchieftca",
